Searching for how to organize a congress in Malaga, Spain, usually means someone who has been asked to bring a group of delegates here and has to decide in which order things happen. A congress has a venue, a hotel for delegates, a program of sessions and a technical side, and each one depends on the one before. This page puts them in order and says who in the city can help with each, including the part that is ours.

Malaga Event Gear (MEG) supplies audiovisual equipment and a technician for congresses across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. We are not a venue, a destination management company or an organizer, so this guide is about the sequence and not about running the event for you. The audiovisual brief is the part we know, and it sits within our [event technology service](/blog/event-technology-service/).

